# W060 — the glTF asset bridge's local (pre-registration) link state.
#
# adapters/foundations/gltf is a NESTED package path that the frozen
# pnpm-workspace.yaml globs ("adapters/*" and "adapters/renderers/*" — one
# level each) do not match, so until the Tech Lead's registration pass adds
# the adapters/foundations/* glob entry, scripts/link-local.mjs builds a
# gitignored local node_modules (workspace-package symlinks only — this
# package has ZERO external dependencies). Post-registration pnpm owns
# node_modules directly and none of this exists. Nothing here is committed.
node_modules
.local-stage
*.tsbuildinfo
